<title>NETHERLANDS: BURGMAN HEYBROEK H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>BURGMAN HEYBROEK H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				45.9  vs  41.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1.60 vs   1.45</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Burgman Heybroek NV. The firm said that</p>
<p>expectations for the second half were not very good. Burgman</p>
<p>Heybroek said it expected slightly lower pre-tax profit. In 1995</p>
<p>full-year pre-tax profit was 1.7 million guilders.</p>
</text>
